sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant Browser
    participant Server

    User->>Browser: Type a new note
    User->>Browser: Click "Save"

    Note over Browser: JavaScript intercepts the form submission

    Browser->>Server: POST /new_note<br/>Form data: note=<user's text>
    activate Server
    Server-->>Browser: HTTP 302 Redirect to /notes
    deactivate Server

    Browser->>Server: GET /notes
    activate Server
    Server-->>Browser: HTML document
    deactivate Server

    Browser->>Server: GET /main.css
    Server-->>Browser: CSS file

    Browser->>Server: GET /main.js
    Server-->>Browser: JavaScript file

    Browser->>Server: GET /data.json
    Server-->>Browser: Updated JSON containing all notes

    Note over Browser: Browser renders the updated notes list, including the new note
